107258680465016.description:
Exert your stamina to dodge out of harm's way, increasing your evasion by $effect1:statmod0.%.nostat$ for up to 0.5s until you successfully dodge an incoming hit. {skill:Universal:General_Stamina_Dodge_EvasiveManeuver:Evasion will be sustained through all hits when a dodge is performed while stamina is at maximum.}

